WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.159
The Carters were eating Thanksgiving dinner.

2
00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:10.238
"I love cranberry sauce!" Mom said.

3
00:00:10.239 --> 00:00:15.653
"Too bad we only eat it at Thanksgiving."

4
00:00:15.654 --> 00:00:20.708
"I like turkey, stuffing, and gravy," Dad said.

5
00:00:20.709 --> 00:00:25.086
"We only have those at Thanksgiving too."

6
00:00:25.087 --> 00:00:29.297
"We eat mashed potatoes all the time," Harry said.

7
00:00:29.298 --> 00:00:32.954
"But I still like them on Thanksgiving."

8
00:00:32.955 --> 00:00:38.053
Emmy and Oliver were too busy eating to talk.

9
00:00:38.054 --> 00:00:42.599
"I cooked a special treat," Aunt Judy said.

10
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:47.123
"Who wants some oyster pie?"

11
00:00:47.124 --> 00:00:50.508
Dad made a face.

12
00:00:50.509 --> 00:00:56.634
"Oyster pie is an old family favorite," Aunt Judy said.

13
00:00:56.635 --> 00:01:01.420
"But your dad is always afraid to try it."

14
00:01:01.421 --> 00:01:06.281
"Oysters look weird!" Dad said.

15
00:01:06.282 --> 00:01:11.358
The kids laughed.

16
00:01:11.359 --> 00:01:16.888
"Does oyster pie taste like pumpkin pie?" Oliver asked.

17
00:01:16.889 --> 00:01:21.016
"No, it's not a dessert," Aunt Judy said.

18
00:01:21.017 --> 00:01:25.190
"But it still tastes good."

19
00:01:25.191 --> 00:01:30.890
"Dad, you always make us try new foods," Emmy said.

20
00:01:30.891 --> 00:01:35.380
"I'll try oyster pie—if you do."

21
00:01:35.381 --> 00:01:40.057
Everyone looked at Dad.

22
00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:44.473
"You go first, Emmy," he said.

23
00:01:44.474 --> 00:01:48.943
Aunt Judy put some oyster pie on their plates.

24
00:01:48.944 --> 00:01:55.159
Emmy took a small bite.

25
00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:59.725
Then she took a bigger bite.

26
00:01:59.726 --> 00:02:05.818
"Mmm! This is good!" she said.

27
00:02:05.819 --> 00:02:12.804
Dad took a bite and swallowed hard.

28
00:02:12.805 --> 00:02:16.610
"I guess it's okay," he said.

29
00:02:16.611 --> 00:02:21.548
"Okay? It's delicious!" Emmy said.

30
00:02:21.549 --> 00:02:27.133
"More oyster pie, please!"

